PHASE 1 — FOUNDATION (Dataverse + Storage)
✅ Step 1 — Create Supporting Tables (Dataverse)
You need a staging layer (don’t skip this).
Create table: Vendor Quote Staging
Columns:

Name (Auto)
Opportunity (Lookup)
File URL
Status (Pending / Processed / Requires Review / Approved)
JSON Payload (Multiline text)


Create table: Vendor Quote Line Staging
Columns:

Parent Staging (Lookup)
Product Name (Text)
Quantity (Decimal)
Cost (Currency)
Matched Product (Lookup to Product)
Match Status (Matched / Unmatched / Low Confidence)


✅ This gives you:

traceability
idempotency control (you care about this)
easier debugging


✅ Step 2 — SharePoint Integration

Create document library: Vendor Quotes
Store uploaded files here

✅ Recommended:

Folder per Opportunity → Opportunity Name / VendorQuotes


